-- Ring homomorphisms f : R →+* S between bundled rings: maps preserving
-- the operations and constants, the bridges to the form over separate
-- pieces, the preservation laws, identity and composite homomorphisms, the
-- kernel ideal, and isomorphisms f : R ≃+* S; everything here is ZF
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
